{"locator": "c3-0755:27h", "id": "c3-0755:27h", "text": "ADDRESSING THE BOARD", "font_pt": 9, "weight": "regular", "prev": "Next Regular Meeting: May 7, 2009, 5:00 p.m.", "next": "Any person shall have the right to address the Board during consideration of any item on the Board\u2019s agenda or during the time for oral communication if not on the agenda but pertaining to subject matter within the jurisdiction of the Board. Any person wishing to address the Board should stand or raise the hand and wait to be recognized by the Chairperson. Please stand at the podium, if able, state your name and address for the record, and proceed to address the Board. All remarks and questions should be addressed to the Board through the Chairperson and not to any member thereof or to the public. No question should be asked a Board member or a member of Authority staff without first obtaining permission of the Chairperson.", "existing_tag": "P", "ancestors": ["Document"], "in_table_box": false, "page": 1, "x0": 76.3195, "y0": 635.5352, "x1": 542.4995, "y1": 647.2352000000001, "card_id": "c3-0755:27h", "document_id": "c3-0755", "kind": "pdf", "repeats_on_pages": 1, "norm": "addressingtheboard", "in_margin_band": false, "after_inline_label": false, "image": "/Users/jphilistin/.codex/worktrees/12c6/ADA Auditor/experiments/qwen-role-decisions/out/suggest/wild-v4-runin/c3-0755/pages/marked-408/c3-0755_27h.png", "image_full": "/Users/jphilistin/.codex/worktrees/12c6/ADA Auditor/experiments/qwen-role-decisions/out/suggest/wild-v4-runin/c3-0755/pages/marked/c3-0755_27h.png"}
{"locator": "c3-0755:27", "id": "c3-0755:27", "text": "Any person shall have the right to address the Board during consideration of any item on the Board\u2019s agenda or during the time for oral communication if not on the agenda but pertaining to subject matter within the jurisdiction of the Board. Any person wishing to address the Board should stand or raise the hand and wait to be recognized by the Chairperson. Please stand at the podium, if able, state your name and address for the record, and proceed to address the Board. All remarks and questions should be addressed to the Board through the Chairperson and not to any member thereof or to the public. No question should be asked a Board member or a member of Authority staff without first obtaining permission of the Chairperson.", "font_pt": 9, "weight": "regular", "prev": "ADDRESSING THE BOARD", "next": "none", "existing_tag": "P", "ancestors": ["Document"], "in_table_box": false, "page": 1, "x0": 76.3195, "y0": 647.2352000000001, "x1": 542.4995, "y1": 738.48, "card_id": "c3-0755:27", "document_id": "c3-0755", "kind": "pdf", "repeats_on_pages": 1, "norm": "", "in_margin_band": true, "after_inline_label": false, "image": "/Users/jphilistin/.codex/worktrees/12c6/ADA Auditor/experiments/qwen-role-decisions/out/suggest/wild-v4-runin/c3-0755/pages/marked-408/c3-0755_27.png", "image_full": "/Users/jphilistin/.codex/worktrees/12c6/ADA Auditor/experiments/qwen-role-decisions/out/suggest/wild-v4-runin/c3-0755/pages/marked/c3-0755_27.png"}
